WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:00.500
End before start.

2
00:00:02.000 -> 00:00:03.000
Single dash arrow.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:abc position:200% size:-5 vertical:diagonal
Bogus settings but a valid timing line.

4
1:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Hour with one digit.

5
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Cue text with --> arrow inside
and an <unclosed tag

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07,000
Comma milliseconds on the end time.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Cue with no blank line before the next one
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Timing line swallowed as text.

00:99:10.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Ninety-nine minutes.
